{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">今屆文憑試新增一名「超級狀元」。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.DSE-1200_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026OXPAT7uVLF1786513807.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.DSE-1200_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">她是來自新界鄉議局元朗區中學的孫菀青。校方指，她成功覆核生物科成績，即考獲6科5**及數學延伸部分同樣考獲5**，成為今屆文憑試第25名狀元。她已獲港大醫學院傑出醫科學人專屬課程取錄。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-12T06:20:45.732702+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}